2e:["$","section",null,{"id":"$undefined","className":"section-padding","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container-wide","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.25fr_1fr]","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl","children":["The business environment in ","Surendranagar"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"Cotton ginning and pressing operate at significant scale, supported by agri trade in cotton, groundnut and cumin. Salt production in the Little Rann area is economically important, along with the associated transport and processing. Small engineering and ceramic units operate from the district's industrial estates, and the Wadhwan-Surendranagar belt supports transport and warehousing."}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-10 text-xl","children":"What this usually means for structure"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"Ginning is seasonal and works on large short-term purchases funded by working capital, which produces concentrated credit exposure in a few months of the year. Where partners are personally liable without limit, a bad season reaches personal assets directly. That makes the partnership-to-LLP question more pressing in ginning than in steadier trades, and it is worth settling before rather than during a season."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-8 rounded-xl border border-border bg-muted p-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":["Raulji Group operates from ","Vadodara",", Gujarat, and serves ","Surendranagar"," remotely. We do not maintain an office in ","Surendranagar",". Company and LLP incorporation is filed online with the Registrar of Companies and digital signatures are issued through video and Aadhaar-based verification, so the process does not require you to travel."," ","Estimated timelines can vary depending on documentation, government processing and other factors outside our control."]}]]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"space-y-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-2 text-lg","children":[["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-building2 h-5 w-5 text-primary","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","1b4qmf",{"d":"M6 22V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v18Z"}],["$","path","i71pzd",{"d":"M6 12H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2"}],["$","path","10jefs",{"d":"M18 9h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"}],["$","path","1itunk",{"d":"M10 6h4"}],["$","path","tcdvrf",{"d":"M10 10h4"}],["$","path","kelpxr",{"d":"M10 14h4"}],["$","path","1ulq68",{"d":"M10 18h4"}],"$undefined"]}],"Business areas in and around ","Surendranagar"]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-2","children":[["$","li","Surendranagar-Wadhwan belt",{"className":"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground","children":[["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-map-pin mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","1r0f0z",{"d":"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"}],["$","circle","ilqhr7",{"cx":"12","cy":"10","r":"3"}],"$undefined"]}],"Surendranagar-Wadhwan belt"]}],["$","li","Surendranagar GIDC",{"className":"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground","children":[["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","